[stderr] +
[stderr] +Every transition has a visible text state and an equivalent touch, pointer,
[stderr] +keyboard, and gamepad action. Focus is visible; pause/resume, timer state,
[stderr] +shortage disclosure, save success/failure, selected answer, correct/incorrect,
